WEBVTT

00:14.700 --> 00:17.500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

00:17.540 --> 00:21.380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

00:24.500 --> 00:29.140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

00:30.540 --> 00:33.220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

00:33.540 --> 00:37.500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

00:37.860 --> 00:40.780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

00:41.620 --> 00:49.300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

00:49.900 --> 00:51.380
♪Together, they are known♪

00:52.060 --> 00:56.660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

01:25.660 --> 01:31.900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:32.060 --> 01:34.980
[Episode 2]
[This story is purely fictional]

01:42.940 --> 01:48.620
[Wu's Residence]

02:41.740 --> 02:44.780
[Memorial Tablet of Late Brother Wu Tie]

03:54.150 --> 03:55.660
You weren't this reserved before,

03:56.310 --> 03:57.380
Master Zhang.

03:58.150 --> 03:58.820
What's wrong?

03:59.310 --> 04:00.260
You haven't come by in so long.

04:00.960 --> 04:02.170
Getting shy now?

04:03.280 --> 04:04.660
Everything's different now.

04:05.080 --> 04:05.780
So,

04:06.190 --> 04:07.260
I should dress more decently.

04:12.520 --> 04:14.060
Even as enemies,

04:15.520 --> 04:17.980
anyone from the Mystic Nine should face each other openly.

04:20.510 --> 04:21.250
This rule

04:23.720 --> 04:24.850
was set by you.

04:29.360 --> 04:30.900
The water's not as hot as it used to be.

04:33.870 --> 04:35.540
People's hearts have grown even colder.

04:39.630 --> 04:41.100
Did the Eighth Master tell you everything?

04:41.920 --> 04:44.540
Why do you always send him to talk to me?

04:45.560 --> 04:46.580
Don't tell me

04:47.630 --> 04:49.290
you don't have the nerve to face me?

05:13.630 --> 05:14.340
What is this?

05:15.750 --> 05:17.050
Fifth Master, if you're interested,

05:18.720 --> 05:20.170
why not go down and have a look yourself?

05:20.600 --> 05:22.020
I'm not interested.

05:22.800 --> 05:23.610
No?

05:24.510 --> 05:26.250
Then why ask me here?

05:26.800 --> 05:28.050
Because you need my help.

05:28.160 --> 05:29.850
Finally, I get to set the terms.

05:30.270 --> 05:32.100
Even if I'm not interested, I have to be.

05:32.720 --> 05:33.610
As expected of you. Straight to the point.

05:34.270 --> 05:35.050
Lives are at stake.

05:35.560 --> 05:36.340
We should depart at once.

05:36.360 --> 05:36.810
Hold on.

05:40.160 --> 05:40.980
How long

05:41.510 --> 05:42.220
has this wall been there?

05:44.560 --> 05:46.100
It's been buried underground for over eighty years.

05:47.510 --> 05:48.460
Over eighty years?

05:50.920 --> 05:51.930
So

05:52.560 --> 05:53.930
waiting another year or two

05:54.160 --> 05:55.290
wouldn't make much difference, would it?

06:05.830 --> 06:06.810
You agreed to see me.

06:07.510 --> 06:09.140
You certainly didn't come here to waste my time.

06:09.950 --> 06:11.100
Get to the point.

06:11.680 --> 06:12.900
But what I want to talk about

06:14.070 --> 06:15.170
may not be what you want.

06:16.240 --> 06:16.980
Laogou,

06:17.680 --> 06:18.980
I didn't come to you

06:19.000 --> 06:19.850
because I had no other choice.

06:20.240 --> 06:20.850
Is that so?

06:26.390 --> 06:27.610
I found something.

06:28.160 --> 06:29.290
No idea whose it is.

06:30.310 --> 06:31.460
Since you're an official,

06:33.040 --> 06:33.410
take a look.

06:47.680 --> 06:48.660
Where's my wife?

06:49.750 --> 06:51.170
I picked up something,

06:51.680 --> 06:52.780
not a woman.

07:05.510 --> 07:06.780
Where is my wife?

07:11.430 --> 07:12.980
Can't wait to kill me?

07:14.000 --> 07:15.140
Looks like

07:15.830 --> 07:18.100
you're not an upright official at all.

07:19.160 --> 07:21.050
You take the law into your own hands

07:21.830 --> 07:23.370
and treat people's lives like they're nothing.

07:25.630 --> 07:27.020
What exactly do you want?

07:28.240 --> 07:30.610
Your wife, or your soldiers.

07:31.830 --> 07:32.810
Pick one.

07:39.310 --> 07:40.580
As a member of the Mystic Nine,

07:42.360 --> 07:44.170
you went back on your oath

07:45.600 --> 07:47.290
by laying a hand on an ordinary civilian.

07:48.360 --> 07:49.580
Have you no shame

07:50.240 --> 07:51.810
calling Yin Xinyue an ordinary civilian?

07:53.120 --> 07:55.410
If you can kill, why can't I?

07:56.360 --> 07:57.490
One life

07:58.190 --> 08:00.250
for 127 lives.

08:01.870 --> 08:02.850
That's a fair trade, isn't it?

08:04.120 --> 08:05.660
You're still stuck in the past.

08:06.560 --> 08:07.100
No.

08:08.510 --> 08:10.050
I'm stuck

08:11.430 --> 08:12.700
in the day you pulled the trigger.

08:39.910 --> 08:40.770
Zhang Qishan,

08:41.600 --> 08:42.460
admit it.

08:43.200 --> 08:44.420
You're selfish.

08:46.510 --> 08:47.580
You can't decide.

09:00.440 --> 09:02.180
I removed a bone from your spine.

09:02.630 --> 09:03.370
It won't kill you,

09:04.510 --> 09:06.180
but you'll be crippled for life.

09:07.320 --> 09:09.580
The longer this goes on, the less you'll be able to move.

09:12.790 --> 09:14.010
I'm not even afraid of death.

09:14.550 --> 09:15.770
Why would I fear being crippled?

09:17.240 --> 09:18.130
You may not,

09:19.000 --> 09:20.300
but those men under you will.

09:21.480 --> 09:23.250
They'll come begging me to save you.

09:24.270 --> 09:25.890
They'll surely release my wife

09:26.720 --> 09:27.490
and bring the dogs

09:28.150 --> 09:29.100
to rescue my soldiers.

09:30.750 --> 09:31.580
Xiaozhu,

09:32.080 --> 09:32.820
bite me.

10:00.750 --> 10:02.610
I know you wouldn't hurt innocent people.

10:03.670 --> 10:04.700
But every wrong

10:05.390 --> 10:06.130
has someone to answer for.

10:06.870 --> 10:07.820
If it's a life you want,

10:09.000 --> 10:10.130
take mine.

10:10.870 --> 10:11.530
Name your price.

10:12.550 --> 10:13.820
I want you to disappear.

10:15.240 --> 10:16.650
I'll return your wife

10:17.440 --> 10:18.890
and save your soldiers.

10:20.390 --> 10:21.300
But you

10:22.270 --> 10:23.610
must leave the Mystic Nine

10:24.750 --> 10:25.770
and leave Changsha.

10:27.510 --> 10:28.940
I never want to see you again.

10:30.870 --> 10:31.420
Fine.

10:33.440 --> 10:34.220
You agree?

10:35.030 --> 10:36.060
Once I leave the Mystic Nine,

10:37.390 --> 10:38.980
Xie Jiu will take my place.

10:39.750 --> 10:40.490
I can leave with peace of mind.

10:41.360 --> 10:42.010
I promise.

10:42.910 --> 10:43.700
I'm a man of my word.

10:44.960 --> 10:45.580
I don't believe you.

10:45.840 --> 10:46.650
Put it in writing.

10:46.790 --> 10:47.610
I'm not writing that.

10:50.030 --> 10:50.980
Then what do you suggest?

10:52.390 --> 10:53.730
Swear an oath.

10:55.000 --> 10:55.530
Fine.

11:01.000 --> 11:01.580
Tiezui.

11:03.510 --> 11:04.420
Call Tiezui over.

11:06.390 --> 11:06.820
Laogou,

11:07.910 --> 11:09.820
can we skip a couple of lines?

11:10.510 --> 11:11.060
No.

11:11.670 --> 11:12.420
Not a single word.

11:13.360 --> 11:13.770
Swear it.

11:17.080 --> 11:17.490
Fine.

11:19.510 --> 11:19.890
I...

11:20.390 --> 11:21.250
I swear.

11:21.790 --> 11:23.100
Today, I witness the agreement

11:23.440 --> 11:24.490
between Master Zhang and Wu Laogou.

11:25.240 --> 11:27.610
If Laogou rescues

11:27.630 --> 11:29.250
those who disappeared under the hospital,

11:29.600 --> 11:30.490
Master Zhang will...

11:31.320 --> 11:31.760
He...

11:32.360 --> 11:33.530
He will leave the Mystic Nine.

11:33.960 --> 11:36.180
If I fail to make sure he keeps his word,

11:36.750 --> 11:37.300
from this day on,

11:39.320 --> 11:41.700
no matter how much money I make, I will lose it all.

11:41.960 --> 11:43.220
Every shop I own will burn down.

11:43.240 --> 11:45.300
The Qi Clan line will end with me,

11:45.440 --> 11:46.220
leaving no descendants.

11:46.360 --> 11:48.700
And if Master Zhang breaks this oath,

11:48.910 --> 11:50.770
Laogou will no longer be bound by the rules of the Mystic Nine,

11:50.910 --> 11:52.180
and the Zhang and Wu Clans may fight each other.

11:52.240 --> 11:53.220
No one may interfere.

11:53.360 --> 11:53.940
Happy now?

11:56.080 --> 11:57.460
You two are such a pain.

11:59.390 --> 12:00.220
Get everyone out,

12:00.910 --> 12:01.770
and I'll leave the Mystic Nine.

12:03.270 --> 12:04.300
That's the deal.

12:05.510 --> 12:06.420
When do we leave?

12:06.790 --> 12:07.460
Tomorrow morning at eight.

12:07.870 --> 12:08.530
Where's my wife?

12:08.720 --> 12:09.340
Don't worry.

12:10.240 --> 12:11.130
My word is my bond.

12:11.960 --> 12:13.490
When I give my word,

12:14.120 --> 12:14.820
I keep it, no matter what.

12:23.910 --> 12:24.650
Zhang Qishan.

12:30.270 --> 12:31.130
I'll do this for you.

12:32.600 --> 12:33.850
But let me make one thing clear.

12:35.030 --> 12:36.010
I'm not doing this

12:37.240 --> 12:38.220
to help you.

12:39.670 --> 12:40.580
I'm doing it

12:40.600 --> 12:41.730
for those still missing.

12:43.440 --> 12:44.850
Get this through your thick skull.

12:47.200 --> 12:48.370
Between you and me,

12:49.600 --> 12:51.220
you owe me a life.

12:57.510 --> 12:57.890
Laogou,

12:58.200 --> 12:58.890
I'll be on my way.

12:59.360 --> 12:59.850
Bye.

13:00.840 --> 13:01.220
Master Zhang.

13:12.030 --> 13:12.530
Master Zhang.

13:13.030 --> 13:13.850
Wait.

13:14.000 --> 13:14.890
Wait for me, Master Zhang.

13:16.360 --> 13:16.690
I...

13:16.750 --> 13:17.840
I'll go with you.

13:21.120 --> 13:21.580
Tiezui,

13:22.440 --> 13:23.420
what kind of person am I

13:24.080 --> 13:24.940
to you?

13:32.390 --> 13:32.850
Master Zhang,

13:33.150 --> 13:34.130
you're not taking me back?

13:34.510 --> 13:35.370
You hesitated.

13:35.720 --> 13:36.300
I'm not happy.

13:36.910 --> 13:37.340
Wait, I...

13:38.720 --> 13:39.060
Master Zhang.

13:40.510 --> 13:40.980
Master Zhang!

13:41.390 --> 13:42.060
Master Zhang!

13:43.360 --> 13:43.730
You...

13:44.150 --> 13:44.890
It's a long way back.

13:44.910 --> 13:46.340
Are you making me walk all the way back?

13:46.790 --> 13:47.810
You're ditching me already?

13:47.810 --> 13:48.300
You...

13:48.840 --> 13:49.220
Jeez.

13:59.630 --> 14:00.010
Master Zhang,

14:00.720 --> 14:02.130
I've had them seal up the hole.

14:03.030 --> 14:03.730
We'll be going down there too,

14:04.480 --> 14:05.530
so be careful not to get possessed.

14:05.720 --> 14:06.420
Possessed?

14:06.750 --> 14:07.530
It can spread?

14:08.480 --> 14:09.650
Ghosts or demons,

14:10.320 --> 14:11.180
there's always someone pulling the strings.

14:12.320 --> 14:13.420
Pick our best men

14:14.000 --> 14:14.730
and have them ready.

14:15.240 --> 14:16.130
We move out

14:16.480 --> 14:17.250
first thing in the morning.

14:18.030 --> 14:18.300
Yes, sir.

14:21.000 --> 14:21.820
What about Madam?

14:21.950 --> 14:23.120
Laogou won't go back on his word.

14:25.670 --> 14:26.770
He may not be educated,

14:27.720 --> 14:28.650
but he's no petty villain.

14:29.910 --> 14:31.220
Knowing Madam's temper,

14:32.440 --> 14:33.490
once she gets back...

14:37.060 --> 14:39.720
[Wu Kennels]

14:39.720 --> 14:40.300
Good morning.

14:53.440 --> 14:53.850
Fifth Master.

14:54.120 --> 14:54.490
Fifth Master.

14:55.200 --> 14:55.580
How is it?

14:55.840 --> 14:56.420
Don't worry.

14:57.000 --> 14:58.370
Tianpeng and I have been watching.

14:58.840 --> 15:00.100
Not a sound from inside.

15:00.670 --> 15:02.100
The drug probably hasn't worn off yet.

15:02.600 --> 15:03.980
Madam Zhang is still unconscious.

15:05.390 --> 15:06.180
Good.

15:07.720 --> 15:09.490
Kidnapping someone's wife wasn't exactly our choice,

15:10.240 --> 15:11.100
but it's pretty shameful.

15:12.240 --> 15:13.650
Send her back before she wakes up.

15:14.120 --> 15:14.420
Open the door.

15:14.600 --> 15:14.890
Alright.

15:28.240 --> 15:28.770
Fifth Master,

15:29.240 --> 15:29.820
see?

15:30.150 --> 15:31.100
I told you.

15:44.720 --> 15:45.100
Fifth Master!

15:52.860 --> 15:54.660
[Yin Xinyue]

15:56.120 --> 15:57.060
As per the Wu Clan's rule,

15:57.550 --> 15:58.610
we don't hit women.

16:01.440 --> 16:01.700
You!

16:02.750 --> 16:03.730
You said it yourself.

16:04.080 --> 16:04.770
No hitting women.

16:09.030 --> 16:09.850
Wu Laogou,

16:11.030 --> 16:12.220
why are you here?

16:14.320 --> 16:14.890
Not bad.

16:15.960 --> 16:17.010
You turned the junk here

16:17.150 --> 16:18.130
into traps.

16:18.990 --> 16:20.490
You've learned quite a lot from your husband.

16:22.630 --> 16:24.770
I'm the young mistress of Xinyue Restaurant.

16:25.670 --> 16:26.610
I've been playing with this stuff

16:27.120 --> 16:28.850
since I was a kid.

16:30.360 --> 16:31.420
Xinyue Restaurant.

16:32.000 --> 16:33.530
The biggest auction house in Beiping.

16:34.440 --> 16:35.460
When will you take me there,

16:35.480 --> 16:36.650
Young Mistress?

16:37.670 --> 16:39.130
Not while you're alive.

16:39.790 --> 16:41.580
Maybe after you're dead.

16:42.000 --> 16:43.940
The body of Wu Laogou of the Mystic Nine

16:44.750 --> 16:46.530
should fetch a reasonable price.

16:46.870 --> 16:48.370
You have so many enemies.

16:49.000 --> 16:50.010
There wouldn't be enough to go around even if I chopped you into pieces.

16:54.790 --> 16:55.180
Give them back.

16:56.870 --> 16:57.700
What?

16:58.720 --> 16:59.730
My Twin Chime Bracelets.

17:00.270 --> 17:01.650
You stole them.

17:02.790 --> 17:03.480
My husband gave them to me

17:03.480 --> 17:04.610
as our love token.

17:04.610 --> 17:05.220
They're important to me.

17:05.350 --> 17:06.180
Give them back.

17:08.200 --> 17:09.180
Give them back.

17:09.200 --> 17:10.290
Now.

17:10.470 --> 17:11.610
- Don't hit me. - Give them back.

17:12.160 --> 17:12.560
You!

17:12.680 --> 17:13.380
You kidnapped me.

17:13.960 --> 17:15.220
What are you planning to do to my husband?

17:19.000 --> 17:19.980
Little wretch.

17:20.550 --> 17:22.250
Like husband, like wife.

17:23.270 --> 17:24.330
We're cut

17:24.440 --> 17:25.460
from the same cloth.

17:26.270 --> 17:27.620
That's why he's my husband.

17:28.110 --> 17:29.660
We've finished talking.

17:30.270 --> 17:31.330
I'll send you back later.

17:32.110 --> 17:32.980
What did you two talk about?

17:33.440 --> 17:34.900
That's between men. Don't ask.

17:34.960 --> 17:35.810
Between men, my foot.

17:35.880 --> 17:36.290
Tell me.

17:36.790 --> 17:38.290
What did you and my husband talk about?

17:42.790 --> 17:43.700
You won't say?

17:45.480 --> 17:46.530
I'll kill you.

17:47.160 --> 17:48.490
Whatever you agreed on

17:48.640 --> 17:49.570
won't count anymore.

17:50.830 --> 17:51.620
Go on then.

18:03.070 --> 18:03.620
What's going on now?

18:04.000 --> 18:04.290
Uh.

18:04.830 --> 18:05.900
She's not leaving?

18:06.550 --> 18:07.420
She has to.

18:07.830 --> 18:08.700
Otherwise, Master Zhang will think

18:08.720 --> 18:09.770
we broke our word.

18:10.070 --> 18:11.090
Let's carry her out.

18:12.030 --> 18:12.570
Enough.

18:14.310 --> 18:14.770
Hold your horses.

18:14.960 --> 18:15.700
No more fooling around.

18:16.510 --> 18:17.490
They'll take you back.

18:20.590 --> 18:21.980
There's no point staying here.

18:22.750 --> 18:23.860
An agreement between men

18:23.880 --> 18:25.090
isn't easily broken.

18:27.790 --> 18:28.180
Fine.

18:28.960 --> 18:30.490
I'll have Zhang Qishan come get you himself.

18:31.350 --> 18:32.140
Wu Laogou.

18:33.550 --> 18:35.330
You don't understand women.

18:35.880 --> 18:37.330
Or men, for that matter.

18:39.750 --> 18:40.940
Do you think

18:41.240 --> 18:42.330
a man who knows

18:42.400 --> 18:43.860
the woman he loves

18:43.920 --> 18:44.980
has been bullied

18:46.000 --> 18:47.570
would still work with you?

18:49.880 --> 18:50.860
My dear lady,

18:51.550 --> 18:53.140
what exactly do you want?

18:53.720 --> 18:54.980
Renegotiate everything.

18:55.200 --> 18:55.730
Out of the question.

18:56.440 --> 18:57.940
Zhang Qishan must leave the Mystic Nine.

18:59.920 --> 19:01.250
Leave the Mystic Nine?

19:03.510 --> 19:05.010
Your deal with my husband

19:05.240 --> 19:06.620
was for him to leave the Mystic Nine?

19:08.510 --> 19:09.730
I'll level with you.

19:10.590 --> 19:12.330
He asked me to look for Unit 401.

19:12.920 --> 19:14.140
The place where they disappeared

19:14.240 --> 19:16.050
is extremely dangerous. There's little chance of making it back alive.

19:16.590 --> 19:17.770
But once they're found,

19:18.200 --> 19:19.380
he'll leave the Mystic Nine immediately.

19:21.590 --> 19:22.380
And he agreed?

19:22.680 --> 19:23.180
He did.

19:24.920 --> 19:25.940
That's wonderful!

19:31.880 --> 19:32.490
Wu Laogou,

19:33.350 --> 19:34.250
well done.

19:38.030 --> 19:38.900
You just said

19:38.920 --> 19:41.140
the Wu Clan doesn't hit women, right?

19:47.030 --> 19:48.250
You two had a hand in this too, didn't you?

20:13.420 --> 20:15.740
[Changsha Defense Headquarters]

20:21.270 --> 20:21.660
Master Zhang.

20:28.790 --> 20:29.380
Are you alright?

20:34.350 --> 20:35.460
Did Wu Laogou threaten you

20:35.750 --> 20:36.860
with me?

20:40.310 --> 20:41.050
And you agreed?

20:44.510 --> 20:45.460
Zhang Qishan.

20:46.480 --> 20:48.140
Have you always thought I was a burden?

20:50.070 --> 20:51.090
You're laughing?

20:52.270 --> 20:53.860
Did you really think he could keep me locked up?

20:54.110 --> 20:55.940
I beat them out of their crap all by myself.

20:56.110 --> 20:56.900
Hadn't you stepped in,

20:56.920 --> 20:57.900
I would've made it back on my own.

21:04.160 --> 21:06.010
I bought your favorite pastries.

21:08.640 --> 21:09.770
You must be starving.

21:19.790 --> 21:20.290
Try this.

21:24.400 --> 21:24.940
Is it good?

21:26.830 --> 21:27.460
No.

21:27.550 --> 21:28.200
Too sweet.

21:32.110 --> 21:32.570
Try this one.

21:40.750 --> 21:41.380
Just so-so.

21:41.920 --> 21:43.900
Walnut pastries from Sanjizhai are pretty good.

21:44.070 --> 21:45.460
Have them send more.

21:45.830 --> 21:46.770
Not the ones from Laosanhuang.

21:47.000 --> 21:48.090
They're awful. Don't buy them.

21:49.070 --> 21:49.730
Yes, sir.

21:55.880 --> 21:56.730
Zhang Qishan,

21:57.720 --> 21:58.810
Wu Laogou said

21:59.270 --> 22:00.460
you're going somewhere.

22:00.790 --> 22:01.920
It's extremely dangerous.

22:04.400 --> 22:06.010
Just be careful.

22:08.110 --> 22:08.570
Alright.

22:09.350 --> 22:09.900
I will.

22:11.640 --> 22:12.860
I'm not interested

22:12.880 --> 22:13.940
in Mystic Nine business anyway.

22:14.920 --> 22:15.730
Zhang Qishan,

22:16.590 --> 22:18.420
my father wants me to return to Beiping.

22:19.240 --> 22:20.220
He says there are many matters at the Xinyue Restaurant

22:20.240 --> 22:21.620
that need my attention.

22:22.750 --> 22:23.460
When?

22:24.110 --> 22:25.090
Tomorrow.

22:30.960 --> 22:31.980
Once I'm done,

22:33.590 --> 22:34.660
I'll go to Beiping immediately to see you.

22:41.350 --> 22:43.460
My father hasn't accepted you as his son-in-law.

22:43.720 --> 22:44.980
You'd better think carefully

22:45.680 --> 22:48.220
about how to win him over.

22:49.070 --> 22:49.570
Don't worry.

22:50.030 --> 22:50.570
This time,

22:52.480 --> 22:54.380
I'll try everything I can to make him accept me.

22:55.380 --> 22:58.100
[Changsha Defense Headquarters]

23:03.440 --> 23:03.900
Master Zhang,

23:05.350 --> 23:06.140
a telegram from the Ministry of War.

23:10.720 --> 23:11.380
Qishan,

23:12.350 --> 23:13.460
have you made up your mind

23:14.000 --> 23:15.180
about the Mystic Nine?

23:16.920 --> 23:17.900
Don't put it off any longer.

23:29.300 --> 23:32.080
[Taihe Pleasure House]

23:32.080 --> 23:33.080
Don't disappear for so long again

23:33.080 --> 23:34.040
like last time.

23:34.040 --> 23:34.780
Alright.

23:34.780 --> 23:35.560
I'll come by whenever I can.

23:36.030 --> 23:36.900
It's a promise.

23:39.250 --> 23:40.240
Take care.

23:40.620 --> 23:43.300
[Huo Xiangu, Huo Clan of the Mystic Nine]

23:52.330 --> 23:53.430
Have a drink with me.

23:54.140 --> 23:55.150
Sure.

23:55.150 --> 23:56.510
This is for you.

24:02.900 --> 24:07.060
[Ding Qiansui, Manchu loyalist]

24:21.400 --> 24:22.330
Wait outside.

24:23.100 --> 24:24.920
[Huo Nianyi, Huo Clan; Huo Xiaomei, Huo Clan]

24:24.920 --> 24:25.570
Miss Huo,

24:26.310 --> 24:27.570
we'll go in with you.

24:28.790 --> 24:29.220
No need.

24:30.200 --> 24:31.730
But Ding Qiansui

24:32.000 --> 24:33.140
has always been a bully.

24:33.880 --> 24:34.660
We're worried...

24:39.310 --> 24:39.900
Miss Huo,

24:40.240 --> 24:41.420
sorry to trouble you

24:41.640 --> 24:43.050
with this trip.

24:43.480 --> 24:44.250
But don't worry.

24:44.400 --> 24:45.380
Everything has been arranged.

24:45.790 --> 24:47.420
Not a word will get out.

24:49.240 --> 24:49.730
Thank you.

25:00.880 --> 25:01.490
Ding Qiansui,

25:02.400 --> 25:03.490
Miss Huo is here.

25:07.270 --> 25:08.940
Miss Huo,

25:09.270 --> 25:11.320
sorry to make you come all this way.

25:11.320 --> 25:12.400
Well,

25:12.400 --> 25:14.110
I really am sorry.

25:14.790 --> 25:16.290
No need for that, Ding Qiansui.

25:17.680 --> 25:18.770
You didn't invite me here

25:19.310 --> 25:20.810
to catch up.

25:21.790 --> 25:23.050
Let's get to the point.

25:23.680 --> 25:25.250
You're straightforward.

25:25.590 --> 25:27.900
Then I'll skip the pleasantries.

25:28.510 --> 25:29.900
I heard

25:30.110 --> 25:33.490
Zhang Qishan and Wu Laogou have joined forces.

25:34.440 --> 25:36.900
They're heading under the hospital

25:36.960 --> 25:39.330
to search for a missing military unit.

25:40.830 --> 25:42.770
I'd like you

25:42.790 --> 25:44.660
to go down there with them.

25:48.880 --> 25:50.350
Find out

25:50.350 --> 25:52.380
what's going on.

25:53.200 --> 25:55.220
You have plenty of people

25:55.920 --> 25:57.860
who are good at doing dirty work.

25:58.790 --> 26:00.460
Have they all died?

26:01.000 --> 26:03.180
Now you want the head of the Huo Clan to spy for you?

26:06.030 --> 26:06.730
Ding Qiansui,

26:07.590 --> 26:08.460
we may

26:08.460 --> 26:09.570
do business together,

26:09.960 --> 26:11.530
but I can't agree to this.

26:19.750 --> 26:20.530
Miss Huo,

26:21.310 --> 26:22.940
are you leaving?

26:25.620 --> 26:26.920
[Loan Note]

26:26.920 --> 26:29.140
This is your Huo Clan's loan note.

26:29.920 --> 26:33.220
Next month, your family will borrow three thousand silver coins from me.

26:34.160 --> 26:35.290
If I refuse,

26:35.480 --> 26:39.050
your aunts will come begging again.

26:40.070 --> 26:41.700
As for how they'll beg,

26:42.680 --> 26:43.490
well...

26:45.480 --> 26:46.940
Without that money,

26:49.240 --> 26:52.090
whether the Huo Clan can make it through next month,

26:52.720 --> 26:54.180
I couldn't say.

26:55.310 --> 26:56.530
In times like these,

26:57.400 --> 26:59.220
it's not easy for women to survive.

26:59.920 --> 27:01.010
For the Huo Clan

27:01.270 --> 27:03.530
to earn a place among the Mystic Nine was even harder.

27:06.440 --> 27:07.770
This is the fate

27:07.790 --> 27:08.810
of every woman in the Huo Clan.

27:09.380 --> 27:10.110
[Huo Yuping]

27:10.110 --> 27:11.140
[The Huo Sisters Guild]
You have to accept your fate.

27:14.270 --> 27:17.140
I'm just worried

27:19.720 --> 27:21.940
that if the Huo Clan falls

27:24.030 --> 27:26.090
and your enemies

27:27.590 --> 27:30.570
come after you,

27:34.880 --> 27:37.010
what will you do?

27:53.240 --> 27:54.250
So soft.

27:55.830 --> 27:57.730
Your skin is as soft as a baby's.

27:59.590 --> 28:00.570
Xiangu,

28:01.030 --> 28:02.700
you're so beautiful.

28:03.310 --> 28:05.770
If those enemies ruined your face,

28:05.880 --> 28:06.330
I'd be

28:07.920 --> 28:10.050
heartbroken.

28:16.790 --> 28:17.770
Just agree

28:18.510 --> 28:21.050
to spy for me down there,

28:21.510 --> 28:22.620
and I'll lend the money

28:23.480 --> 28:25.660
to the Huo Clan.

28:26.400 --> 28:27.660
Not only that,

28:28.110 --> 28:29.490
I'll wipe out

28:30.240 --> 28:32.330
all your debts.

28:34.960 --> 28:36.220
I know

28:37.310 --> 28:39.660
you're no ordinary woman.

28:41.310 --> 28:43.290
You know how to make a deal.

28:44.510 --> 28:48.250
Does Wu Laogou know about those old debts?

28:49.790 --> 28:51.380
If he did,

28:52.200 --> 28:54.940
I'm sure he would do something.

28:56.590 --> 28:57.050
Would he?

29:13.960 --> 29:14.530
Miss Huo.

29:16.070 --> 29:16.700
Miss Huo,

29:17.200 --> 29:18.220
are you really going to put up with this?

29:18.680 --> 29:20.330
Do we have to do what Ding Qiansui wants?

29:22.880 --> 29:23.660
I'll take care of it.

29:24.310 --> 29:25.180
If you take this matter

29:25.480 --> 29:26.490
to Master Zhang,

29:27.070 --> 29:28.140
by the rules,

29:28.400 --> 29:29.620
he won't agree.

29:30.720 --> 29:32.220
Getting Wu Laogou's help

29:33.550 --> 29:34.700
would be even harder.

29:34.830 --> 29:35.330
Exactly.

29:35.750 --> 29:36.530
Wu Laogou

29:36.790 --> 29:37.980
flirted with you last time,

29:38.160 --> 29:39.290
and even said he wanted to court you.

29:40.240 --> 29:41.810
The elders were strongly against it.

29:43.000 --> 29:45.290
You must hate his guts.

29:45.920 --> 29:47.380
And now you have to ask him for help.

29:49.000 --> 29:50.010
What are you going to do?

29:51.480 --> 29:52.180
Enough.

29:54.110 --> 29:55.010
You wouldn't understand.

29:56.440 --> 29:58.700
Do you have that much faith in Huo Xiangu?

29:59.720 --> 30:02.660
I wouldn't say I have faith in her.

30:03.270 --> 30:06.460
Actually, I have faith in Wu Laogou.

30:07.070 --> 30:09.860
Love is always dependable.

30:39.880 --> 30:40.860
You can go back.

30:44.480 --> 30:45.860
Love

30:46.000 --> 30:48.050
is also the easiest thing to take advantage of.

30:51.790 --> 30:52.860
Turn back.

31:14.590 --> 31:15.420
Why are you here?

31:18.000 --> 31:18.730
I heard

31:18.960 --> 31:20.570
someone called Wu Laogou was flirting with you.

31:21.960 --> 31:22.770
How come I never heard about that?

31:24.830 --> 31:26.220
If you don't clear that up,

31:26.680 --> 31:27.900
what will your family think of me

31:28.880 --> 31:30.010
after I marry into your family?

31:31.720 --> 31:33.180
I think you should put it another way.

31:33.480 --> 31:34.250
For instance,

31:35.240 --> 31:36.250
say I owe you money and won't pay it back.

31:37.880 --> 31:39.980
I'm asking why you're here.

31:41.000 --> 31:41.700
Are you angry?

31:42.830 --> 31:44.330
Men like coming to places like this.

31:45.640 --> 31:47.700
You came here to see Ding Qiansui.

31:48.350 --> 31:49.770
But every time you leave after meeting him,

31:50.270 --> 31:52.010
you get upset and take it out on me.

31:53.240 --> 31:54.330
I was worried about you,

31:54.590 --> 31:55.460
so I came.

31:56.510 --> 31:57.860
I've only been out for an hour.

31:58.750 --> 31:59.730
How did you know where I was?

32:00.510 --> 32:02.730
That old geezer sent me a note.

32:04.920 --> 32:06.770
Ding Qiansui has been hiding out here,

32:07.350 --> 32:08.620
yet he's keeping a close eye on Zhang Qishan.

32:11.480 --> 32:12.090
Turn around.

32:12.590 --> 32:13.620
Ding Qiansui wants me

32:14.070 --> 32:15.330
to follow you and Master Zhang down there

32:15.720 --> 32:16.380
and spy for him.

32:16.830 --> 32:18.010
Ding Qiansui

32:18.640 --> 32:20.330
still hasn't given up on Zhang Qishan.

32:22.510 --> 32:23.620
Did you and Master Zhang make up?

32:26.240 --> 32:27.420
That's between him and me.

32:28.310 --> 32:29.090
Stay out of it.

32:30.790 --> 32:31.900
Even you're keeping me in the dark?

32:35.160 --> 32:35.980
I can tell you.

32:38.440 --> 32:39.380
Once we're married,

32:40.240 --> 32:41.420
I'll tell you everything.

32:47.720 --> 32:48.330
Not now.

32:49.200 --> 32:51.180
I haven't secured my place as the clan head yet.

32:55.790 --> 32:57.010
What about after you become the clan head?

32:58.070 --> 32:58.860
Can we continue?

33:17.750 --> 33:20.330
That Ding fellow actually wants you to work as his spy.

33:21.590 --> 33:22.980
Are all his men dead?

33:25.240 --> 33:25.810
No more talking.

33:26.480 --> 33:27.010
I've got to go.

33:28.110 --> 33:29.460
You must let me know

33:29.680 --> 33:30.530
when Master Zhang goes down there.

33:34.070 --> 33:34.530
Don't go yet.

34:04.550 --> 34:05.980
Those are fireworks from Dongshan House.

34:07.110 --> 34:08.530
But we can only see them from Taihe Pleasure House.

34:12.000 --> 34:13.340
I don't understand the Huo Clan.

34:15.110 --> 34:16.260
But fireworks are free.

34:17.670 --> 34:18.780
Even if they last only a moment,

34:20.400 --> 34:21.570
no one can hold on to them.

34:28.710 --> 34:29.880
We're going underground at eight tomorrow morning.

34:31.400 --> 34:31.980
I'll be waiting for you.

35:25.710 --> 35:26.490
Turn it to the left.

35:27.070 --> 35:28.380
Then lift it up a little.

35:41.920 --> 35:42.490
Who are you?

35:45.400 --> 35:46.340
Shift handover documents.

35:50.550 --> 35:51.340
You're not one of the guards.

35:52.190 --> 35:53.130
You're a military engineer.

35:53.880 --> 35:54.240
But

35:54.480 --> 35:55.340
why are you changing shifts?

35:56.180 --> 35:58.700
[Unit 401, Zhang Peiwu]

35:59.320 --> 35:59.980
Unit 401?

36:01.840 --> 36:04.050
Squad leader, he's from Unit 401.

36:13.320 --> 36:13.780
Squad leader.

36:16.110 --> 36:16.460
Squad leader.

36:22.840 --> 36:23.300
Stop!

36:23.800 --> 36:24.860
Or I'll open fire.

36:53.860 --> 36:58.020
♪The past fades like smoke♪

36:58.380 --> 37:01.100
♪A choice is made in silence♪

37:01.380 --> 37:04.180
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

37:04.580 --> 37:08.340
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

37:08.580 --> 37:12.020
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

37:12.300 --> 37:15.700
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

37:15.780 --> 37:23.060
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

37:23.500 --> 37:26.780
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

37:27.060 --> 37:30.300
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

37:30.460 --> 37:34.500
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

37:34.700 --> 37:38.060
♪Who believes in fate?♪

37:38.300 --> 37:41.660
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

37:41.900 --> 37:45.180
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

37:45.500 --> 37:49.180
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

37:49.380 --> 37:52.620
♪Take care♪

37:52.620 --> 37:55.180
♪We once raced♪

37:55.260 --> 37:57.180
♪For the dawn♪

37:57.340 --> 38:00.620
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

38:00.740 --> 38:04.020
♪In the web of fate♪

38:04.020 --> 38:07.220
♪No one can escape♪

38:08.220 --> 38:10.060
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

38:10.220 --> 38:11.780
♪We too were young once♪

38:11.860 --> 38:15.300
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

38:15.500 --> 38:17.820
♪Keep the ember lit♪

38:17.940 --> 38:22.460
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

38:22.580 --> 38:25.540
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

38:25.780 --> 38:29.300
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

38:29.420 --> 38:33.180
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

38:33.500 --> 38:36.980
♪Who believes in fate?♪

38:37.140 --> 38:40.140
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

38:40.380 --> 38:44.140
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

38:44.300 --> 38:48.020
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

38:48.140 --> 38:59.580
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
